{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"incontent\" id=\"blockcontent\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Article\">\n<div class=\"colleft mt-1\" id=\"date\">\n<p class=\"date\" itemprop=\"datePublished\">發布日期   2026年11月27日 09:05 星期五</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"upper\"><p>早上8時50分，天文台錄得氣溫21.4°C，相對濕度76%。影響廣東沿岸的東北季候風正在緩和。</p></div>\n<div id=\"lower\">\n<div class=\"articlelogin\"><p>本港今日預測大致天晴，市區最高氣溫約25°C，新界再高一兩度。吹輕微至和緩東北風。</p><p>展望周末期間至下周初大致天晴，周六非常乾燥。周日風勢頗大。（天文台）</p></div><p>相關字詞﹕天氣速遞 天文台 天氣 </p> </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T01:43:51.737046+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":170,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T01:05:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T19:57:58.618617+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T01:37:27.171465+00:00","content_hash":"66898b1f88cbd38b487cadeade1fb4ab7c0e5f53f5f919c8dab6232ce81c149e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}